---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Signs a deployment policy naming the origins and releases a deployment serves

Usage: leptoskit verify sign [OPTIONS] --policy <POLICY> --key <KEY> --out <OUT>

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --policy <POLICY>    The policy JSON; see the verifying releases guide
      --key <KEY>          The private key written by `verify keygen`
      --out <OUT>          A new file for the signed policy, served at `/.well-known/leptoskit/deployment.json` on each origin
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
